sepet/api/panels.py:44:                    FROM order_item WHERE order_id = ? ORDER BY id""",
sepet/api/panels.py:45:                 (order["id"],),
sepet/api/panels.py:46:             ).fetchall()
sepet/api/panels.py:47:         ]
