+## 3. Request lifecycle
+
+The frontend calls same-origin `/api/*` paths; Vite proxies those requests to `http://127.0.0.1:8000` (`web/vite.config.ts:6-9`). The shared client attaches a token from localStorage and sends it as `Authorization: Bearer ...` (`web/src/api.ts:3-10`).
+
+### Authentication and wallet
+
+| Endpoint | Lifecycle |
+| --- | --- |
+| `POST /api/auth/register` | Route handler `register` (`accounts.py:59-86`). Calls `validate_registration` (`accounts.py:61` -> `accounts.py:40-47`). Opens a connection (`accounts.py:62`), checks duplicate `user.email` (`accounts.py:63`), inserts `user` (`accounts.py:65-68`), optionally inserts `restaurant` (`accounts.py:70-83`), calls `issue_token` (`accounts.py:85` -> `accounts.py:50-56`), and the `with` block commits on success. Returns token/user (`accounts.py:86`). |
+| `POST /api/auth/login` | Route handler `login` (`accounts.py:89-98`). Opens a connection (`accounts.py:91`), selects `user` by email (`accounts.py:92-94`), verifies the password (`accounts.py:95` -> `db.py:27-33`), calls `issue_token` (`accounts.py:97`), commits, and returns token/user (`accounts.py:98`). |
+| `GET /api/auth/me` | Route handler `me` (`accounts.py:101-103`). FastAPI resolves `get_current_user` (`accounts.py:102` -> `auth.py:23-26`), which depends on `resolve_user` (`auth.py:18-20`) and `_user_from_token` (`auth.py:6-15`). The token lookup joins `auth_token` and `user`. `user_payload` serializes the row (`accounts.py:31-32`). |
+| `POST /api/auth/wallet/topup` | Route handler `top_up_wallet` (`accounts.py:110-123`). `get_current_user` is resolved (`accounts.py:111` -> `auth.py:23-26`). Restricts role to customer (`accounts.py:112-113`). Opens a connection, updates `user.balance` (`accounts.py:116-119`), checks the update (`accounts.py:120-121`), selects the new balance (`accounts.py:122`), commits, and returns it (`accounts.py:123`). |
+
+### Restaurants, menus, and orders
+
+| Endpoint | Lifecycle |
+| --- | --- |
+| `GET /api/restaurants` | Route handler `list_restaurants` (`main.py:33-70`). Builds filters (`main.py:35-43`), opens a connection, selects all matching `restaurant` rows (`main.py:47-48`), aggregates `restaurant_review` averages (`main.py:49-54`), combines the seed rating with one aggregated review row through `displayed_rating` (`main.py:55-61` -> `reviews.py:13-15`), then filters/sorts in Python (`main.py:63-70`). |
+| `GET /api/cuisines` | Route handler `list_cuisines` (`main.py:73-79`). Opens a connection and selects distinct `restaurant.cuisine` (`main.py:75-78`), then serializes strings (`main.py:79`). |
+| `GET /api/restaurants/{restaurant_id}` | Route handler `get_restaurant` (`main.py:82-116`). Resolves optional user (`main.py:83` -> `auth.py:18-30` -> `auth.py:6-15`). Selects restaurant (`main.py:85-87`), menu items (`main.py:90-93`), and reviews joined to user emails (`main.py:94-99`). Calls `displayed_rating` (`main.py:103` -> `reviews.py:13-15`). If a customer is signed in, checks a confirmed order (`main.py:106-111`) and prior review (`main.py:112-115`). Serializes restaurant, menu, reviews, and flags (`main.py:100-116`). |
+| `GET /api/orders/{order_id}` | Route handler `get_order` (`main.py:119-139`). There is no auth dependency. Selects the order joined with restaurant (`main.py:121-128`), selects order items (`main.py:131-136`), and returns full order plus items (`main.py:137-139`). |
+| `POST /api/orders` | Route handler `create_order` (`main.py:142-214`). Resolves `require_customer` (`main.py:143` -> `auth.py:33-36` -> `auth.py:23-26` -> `auth.py:6-15`). Validates non-empty items (`main.py:144-147`). Selects restaurant (`main.py:150-154`), selects requested menu items (`main.py:156-161`), checks all IDs belong to that restaurant (`main.py:162-164`), computes subtotal (`main.py:166`), enforces minimum order (`main.py:167-172`), and computes total and missing balance (`main.py:174-180`). Deducts the balance with a guarded update (`main.py:181-186`), inserts `order` (`main.py:189-203`), inserts each `order_item` (`main.py:205-212`), commits, and returns the new order ID (`main.py:214`). |
+| `GET /api/orders/history` | Route handler `order_history` (`panels.py:68-81`). Resolves `require_customer` (`panels.py:69` -> `auth.py:33-36`). Selects customer orders joined to restaurant, user, and courier (`panels.py:71-80`), then passes rows and the same connection to `serialize_orders` (`panels.py:81` -> `panels.py:35-49`), which selects `order_item` per order. |
+| `GET /api/restaurant/orders` | Route handler `restaurant_orders` (`panels.py:84-103`). Resolves `require_restaurant` (`panels.py:87` -> `auth.py:39-48`), builds a restaurant-scoped order query (`panels.py:90-100`), executes it (`panels.py:101-102`), and serializes items via `serialize_orders` (`panels.py:103` -> `panels.py:35-49`). |
+| `GET /api/restaurant/couriers` | Route handler `list_couriers` (`panels.py:106-114`). Resolves `require_restaurant` (`panels.py:107`), selects couriers for the restaurant (`panels.py:109-113`), and serializes them (`panels.py:114`). |
+| `GET /api/restaurant/menu-items` | Route handler `list_menu_items` (`panels.py:117-125`). Resolves `require_restaurant` (`panels.py:118`), selects menu items for the restaurant (`panels.py:120-124`), and serializes them (`panels.py:125`). |
+| `POST /api/restaurant/couriers` | Route handler `create_courier` (`panels.py:128-145`). Resolves `require_restaurant` (`panels.py:129`), validates name (`panels.py:131-132`), checks duplicate user email (`panels.py:134-135`), inserts `user` with courier role (`panels.py:136-139`), inserts the linked `courier` profile (`panels.py:141-144`), commits, and returns the profile (`panels.py:145`). |
+| `POST /api/restaurant/menu-items` | Route handler `add_menu_item` (`panels.py:148-157`). Resolves `require_restaurant` (`panels.py:149`), inserts `menu_item` scoped to the restaurant (`panels.py:151-156`), commits, and returns it (`panels.py:157`). |
+| `POST /api/restaurant/orders/{order_id}/assign-courier` | Route handler `assign_courier` (`panels.py:160-187`). Resolves `require_restaurant` (`panels.py:163-164` -> `auth.py:39-48`). Selects the order (`panels.py:169-171`), checks restaurant ownership (`panels.py:172-173`), checks status equals the correctly encoded `hazırlanıyor` (`panels.py:174-175`), selects a restaurant-owned courier (`panels.py:176-181`), updates order status/time/courier (`panels.py:182-186`), commits, and returns the new status (`panels.py:187`). |
+| `GET /api/courier/orders` | Route handler `courier_orders` (`panels.py:190-204`). Resolves `require_courier` (`panels.py:191` -> `auth.py:51-60`), selects orders assigned to that courier (`panels.py:193-203`), and serializes items (`panels.py:204` -> `panels.py:35-49`). |
+| `POST /api/courier/orders/{order_id}/deliver` | Route handler `deliver_order` (`panels.py:207-223`). Resolves `require_courier` (`panels.py:208`). Selects the order (`panels.py:212-214`), checks courier ownership (`panels.py:215-216`) and status `kuryede` (`panels.py:217-218`), updates status to `teslim_edildi` and sets `delivered_at` (`panels.py:219-222`), commits, and returns the status (`panels.py:223`). |
+| `POST /api/orders/{order_id}/confirm_delivery` | Route handler `confirm_delivery` (`panels.py:226-241`). Resolves `require_customer` (`panels.py:227`). Selects the order (`panels.py:230-232`), checks customer ownership (`panels.py:233-234`) and status `teslim_edildi` (`panels.py:235-236`), updates status to `onaylandı` and sets `confirmed_at` (`panels.py:237-240`), commits, and returns the status (`panels.py:241`). |
+| `GET /api/restaurant/earnings` | Route handler `restaurant_earnings` (`panels.py:247-272`). Resolves `require_restaurant` (`panels.py:248`). Calculates all-order count/revenue (`panels.py:250-256`) and confirmed count/revenue using `onayland\u0131` (`panels.py:257-263`). Computes averages and returns the summary (`panels.py:264-272`). |
+| `POST /api/restaurants/{restaurant_id}/reviews` | Route handler `create_review` (`reviews.py:18-50`). Resolves `require_customer` (`reviews.py:22`). Checks restaurant existence (`reviews.py:27-31`), requires a correctly encoded confirmed order (`reviews.py:32-38`), checks duplicate review (`reviews.py:39-43`), inserts `restaurant_review` (`reviews.py:44-49`), commits, and returns the review (`reviews.py:50`). |
