+| `reviews.py` | `auth.get_optional_user`, `require_customer` | `reviews.py:5` | `get_optional_user` is imported but not used in this module; review creation uses `require_customer` (`reviews.py:22`). |
+| `reviews.py` | `db.get_db`, `utc_now` | `reviews.py:6` | Connection at `reviews.py:26`; timestamp at `reviews.py:48`. |
+| `reviews.py` | `panels.ReviewInput` | `reviews.py:7` | Reuses the Pydantic payload model (`reviews.py:21`). |
+| `seed.py` | `db.hash_password`, `db.utc_now` | `seed.py:4` | Demo password at `seed.py:193`; timestamp at `seed.py:194`. |
+| `seed.py` | `schema.sql` | `seed.py:8`, `seed.py:164-166` | Executes the schema file during reseed. |
