+
+## 4. Data model
+
+| Table and columns | Endpoints that touch it |
+| --- | --- |
+| `restaurant` (`schema.sql:1-11`): `id`, `name`, `cuisine`, `rating`, `delivery_fee`, `min_order`, `eta_minutes`, `image_emoji`, `user_id`. | Read: restaurants (`main.py:44-48`), cuisines (`main.py:73-79`), restaurant detail (`main.py:85-87`), order detail joins (`main.py:122-128`), history/panel/courier/order queries (`panels.py:52-60`, `panels.py:71-80`, `panels.py:90-96`, `panels.py:194-201`), reviews (`reviews.py:27-29`), seed lookup (`seed.py:200-203`). Write: registration (`accounts.py:70-83`), seed (`seed.py:168-181`, `seed.py:211-214`). |
