+# Sepet End-to-End Audit
+
+This audit covers the FastAPI backend, the SQLite schema/seed path, and the React frontend. Line references are to files under `sepet/` unless otherwise stated.
+
+## 1. Module map
+
+| Python module | Responsibilities | Database tables read | Database tables written |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| `api/accounts.py` | Registration, login, current-user lookup, wallet top-up, token creation, and password validation. A restaurant registration also creates its restaurant profile. | `user` (`accounts.py:63`, `accounts.py:92-94`) | `user` (`accounts.py:65-68`, `accounts.py:116-119`), `auth_token` (`accounts.py:52-55`), `restaurant` (`accounts.py:70-83`) |
+| `api/auth.py` | Resolves Bearer tokens to users and provides mandatory, optional, customer, restaurant, and courier auth dependencies. | `auth_token` and `user` (`auth.py:10-15`), `restaurant` (`auth.py:42-45`), `courier` (`auth.py:54-57`) | None |
+| `api/db.py` | Creates SQLite connections, supplies UTC timestamps, and implements PBKDF2 password hashing/verification. It has no direct business logic. | None | None |
+| `api/main.py` | Builds the FastAPI application, mounts routers, and implements restaurant/cuisine listing, restaurant detail, order detail, and order creation. | `restaurant` (`main.py:44-48`, `main.py:85-87`), `restaurant_review` (`main.py:51-53`, `main.py:94-99`, `main.py:112-115`), `menu_item` (`main.py:90-93`, `main.py:157-161`), `order` (`main.py:107-111`, `main.py:122-128`), `order_item` (`main.py:131-136`) | `user` balance (`main.py:181-184`), `order` (`main.py:189-203`), `order_item` (`main.py:207-211`) |
+| `api/panels.py` | Implements customer order history, restaurant and courier panels, courier creation, menu creation, order status transitions, and earnings summaries. | `order` and related restaurant/user/courier fields (`panels.py:52-60`, `panels.py:71-80`, `panels.py:90-96`, `panels.py:169-171`, `panels.py:194-201`, `panels.py:212-214`, `panels.py:230-232`, `panels.py:251-263`), `order_item` (`panels.py:41-45`), `restaurant` (`panels.py:53-59`, `panels.py:90-96`), `user` (`panels.py:53-59`, `panels.py:90-96`, `panels.py:134`), `courier` (`panels.py:59`, `panels.py:111`, `panels.py:176-179`), `menu_item` (`panels.py:121-123`) | `user` (`panels.py:136-139`), `courier` (`panels.py:141-143`), `menu_item` (`panels.py:152-155`), `order` (`panels.py:182-185`, `panels.py:219-222`, `panels.py:237-239`) |
+| `api/reviews.py` | Implements restaurant reviews for customers with confirmed orders and centralizes displayed-rating calculation. | `restaurant` (`reviews.py:27-29`), `order` (`reviews.py:32-36`), `restaurant_review` (`reviews.py:39-42`) | `restaurant_review` (`reviews.py:44-49`) |
+| `api/seed.py` | Deletes and recreates the SQLite database, applies `schema.sql`, and inserts restaurants, menus, users, owners, and couriers. | `restaurant` (`seed.py:200-203`) | `restaurant` (`seed.py:168-181`, `seed.py:211-214`), `menu_item` (`seed.py:183-191`), `user` (`seed.py:195-218`), `courier` (`seed.py:220-227`) |
+
+`schema.sql` is not a Python module, but it is the data model source: it defines eight tables (`schema.sql:1-77`) and is applied by `seed.py:164-166`. Backend dependencies are limited to FastAPI, Uvicorn, and Pydantic (`api/requirements.txt:1-3`).
+
+## 2. Coupling
+
+| Dependent module | Depends on | Import/use sites | Coupling detail |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| `accounts.py` | `auth.get_current_user` | `accounts.py:7` | Used by `/api/auth/me` (`accounts.py:102`) and wallet top-up (`accounts.py:111`). |
+| `accounts.py` | `db.get_db`, `hash_password`, `utc_now`, `verify_password` | `accounts.py:8` | Connections at `accounts.py:62`, `accounts.py:91`, `accounts.py:115`; password hash at `accounts.py:67`; timestamps at `accounts.py:54`; verification at `accounts.py:95`. |
