+
+## 3. Request lifecycle
+
+The frontend calls same-origin `/api/*` paths; Vite proxies those requests to `http://127.0.0.1:8000` (`web/vite.config.ts:6-9`). The shared client attaches a token from localStorage and sends it as `Authorization: Bearer ...` (`web/src/api.ts:3-10`).
+
+### Authentication and wallet
+
+| Endpoint | Lifecycle |
+| --- | --- |
